    <a class="secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kranthi-n" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
    <a class="secondary" href="/downloads/Kranthi-Kumar-Nagulapally-Resume.pdf" download>Download Resume</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <a class="footer-brand" href="#top">Enterprise Agile</a>
  <p>Enterprise program leadership, operational excellence and responsible AI adoption.</p>
  <div class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#success-stories">Success Stories</a>
    <a href="/models/executive-portfolio/">Leadership Views</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
